      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 4,
      "secondaryCue": 3,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "这个周末如果不下雨的话我们就去河边骑车然后在草地上野餐好不好\nIf it doesn't rain this weekend, let's ride along the river and have a picnic on the grass."
