      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 5,
      "secondaryCue": 4,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "我刚刚看了一下 明天早上七点半出发应该来得及 不过今晚要早点睡\nI just checked. If we leave at 7:30 tomorrow morning we'll make it, but we should sleep early tonight."
    },
    {
